<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeVry started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said Thursday analyst Peter Appert had started coverage of DeVry Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the technical education company opened up 1/8 at 22-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
